        padding: const const EdgeInsets.symmetric(vertical: 12),
        shape: RoundedRectangleBorder(borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(8)),
      ),
      child: const Text(
        '다시 시도',
        style: TextStyle(fontSize: 14, fontWeight: FontWeight.w500),
      ),
